# The test chat open while alice's other device asks for a card in it: no notice for the chat looked at (the app told
# the core it shows it, client.focus); the card comes in the chat.
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
# (the app's client.focus reaches the station before the other device asks: outside the app)
wait 1500
log do: peer send 看着的时候 {T} card:这个不该通知 {T}|好 {T}|不好 {T}
timeout 150000
untiln 2 这个不该通知 {T}
# (time for a notice that should not come to come: the core's, the system's)
wait 5000
nonotice 这个不该通知 {T}
shot 1-chat
back
until 端到端测试
# (the same, after leaving the chat)
wait 3000
nonotice 这个不该通知 {T}
